WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.436 --> 00:00:06.567
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:06.768 --> 00:00:09.133
Ah, geez, I'm runnin' late!

00:00:09.783 --> 00:00:10.450
PA: Good morning,

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:11.140
Who said that?!

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:13.020
PA: and welcome to the Black
Mesa Transit System.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:13.949
Oh, it's the intercom.

00:00:13.949 --> 00:00:17.314
PA: This automated train is provided
for the security and convenience...

00:00:17.314 --> 00:00:20.124
Ah, I'm not the only one who's late.

00:00:20.124 --> 00:00:22.120
SUCKER!

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:22.952
Ha hah!

00:00:22.952 --> 00:00:25.984
PA: The time is 8:47 AM.

00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:27.101
PA: The time is 8:47 AM.
Shit!

00:00:27.101 --> 00:00:28.566
I didn't know I was THAT late!

00:00:28.566 --> 00:00:31.028
PA: Current topside temperature is
Oh, man...

00:00:31.028 --> 00:00:34.004
PA: 93 degrees
8:47...

00:00:34.004 --> 00:00:37.376
PA: with an estimated high of 105.
I am so dead.

00:00:37.376 --> 00:00:40.162
PA: The Black Mesa Compound is maintained
Shit...

00:00:40.162 --> 00:00:42.831
PA: at a pleasant 68 degrees
at all times.

00:00:42.831 --> 00:00:46.290
I need to buy a watch; I'm already
on probation with the company.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:47.406
They could fire me.

00:00:47.406 --> 00:00:49.653
PA: This train is inbound from

00:00:49.653 --> 00:00:50.317
Oh well!

00:00:50.317 --> 00:00:53.341
PA: Level 3 Dormitories to
What can you do?

00:00:53.341 --> 00:00:56.617
PA: Sector C Test Labs and
Control Facilities.

00:00:56.617 --> 00:00:57.021
Bzzt!

00:00:57.021 --> 00:00:59.166
PA: If your intended destination

00:00:59.166 --> 00:01:01.575
PA: is a high-security area
High-security...

00:01:01.575 --> 00:01:07.933
PA: beyond Sector C, you will need to
return to the Central Transit Hub in Area 9,

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:09.219
Am I on the right train?

00:01:09.219 --> 00:01:11.634
PA: and board a high-security train.

00:01:11.634 --> 00:01:15.868
PA: If you have not yet submitted your
identity to the Retinal Clearance System,

00:01:15.868 --> 00:01:17.567
PA: you must report to
Oh!  What's this?

00:01:17.567 --> 00:01:18.801
PA: Black Mesa personnel

00:01:18.801 --> 00:01:21.834
PA: for processing before you
will be permitted

00:01:21.834 --> 00:01:23.508
PA: into the High Security Branch
Huh... what...?

00:01:23.508 --> 00:01:25.553
PA: of the Transit System.
Yeah, "High Security"!

00:01:25.553 --> 00:01:29.398
That's why we leave armed missiles
lying around for everyone to check out.

00:01:29.398 --> 00:01:30.789
It's part of the tour.

00:01:30.789 --> 00:01:33.343
PA: Due to the high toxicity of material

00:01:33.343 --> 00:01:36.768
routinely handled in the
Black Mesa Compound,

00:01:36.768 --> 00:01:40.624
PA: no smoking, eating,
or drinking are permitted

00:01:40.624 --> 00:01:42.205
PA: within the Black Mesa Transit System.
Fascists!

00:01:42.205 --> 00:01:44.787
Yeah, whatever, I'll drink a
40-ounce up here if I feel like it.

00:01:44.787 --> 00:01:48.514
PA: Please keep your limbs
inside the train at all times.

00:01:48.514 --> 00:01:51.642
Yeah, well, I'll stick my arms
out the window if I-- Okay, maybe not.

00:01:51.642 --> 00:01:56.523
PA: ...until the train has complete
halt at the station platform.

00:01:56.523 --> 00:01:59.074
PA: In the event of an emergency,

00:01:59.074 --> 00:02:03.466
passengers are to remain seated
and await further instruction.

00:02:03.466 --> 00:02:04.954
Hey, what's going on there?

00:02:04.954 --> 00:02:06.748
PA: If it is necessary to exit the train,

00:02:06.748 --> 00:02:08.434
PA: disabled personnel should be

00:02:08.435 --> 00:02:10.811
PA: evacuated first.
I should've been a pilot.

00:02:10.812 --> 00:02:14.018
PA: Please, stay away from
electrified rails,

00:02:14.018 --> 00:02:14.391
Hah!

00:02:14.391 --> 00:02:16.697
PA: and proceed to an emergency station
Wow...

00:02:16.697 --> 00:02:18.591
PA: until assistance arrives.

00:02:18.591 --> 00:02:21.369
Man, how dumb would you have to be?

00:02:21.369 --> 00:02:23.391
I mean, they're not gonna to say
something like that

00:02:23.391 --> 00:02:26.033
unless somebody's already
tried to do it, right?

00:02:26.931 --> 00:02:29.822
I guess if I was drunk enough, I
might climb out the window here

00:02:29.822 --> 00:02:32.901
and pull some hangtime on the
electrified tram rail.

00:02:34.076 --> 00:02:36.370
That kind of reminds me of that
squirrel that got caught

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:39.300
between the power lines
one day back at MIT.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:42.698
The thing caught on fire and got
fused to the wires,

00:02:42.698 --> 00:02:47.133
which caused a transformer to blow up
and knock out the power to all of campus.

00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:51.834
That squirrel must've cost the
university at least $10,000.

00:02:51.834 --> 00:02:53.095
That was a good day.

00:02:53.095 --> 00:02:57.036
PA: A reminder that the Black
Mesa Hazard Course Decathlon

00:02:57.036 --> 00:02:57.761
Oh man!

00:02:57.761 --> 00:03:01.450
PA: will commence this evening
at 1900 hours

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:02.438
I forgot about that!

00:03:02.438 --> 00:03:04.527
PA: at the Level 3 Facility.

00:03:04.527 --> 00:03:08.719
PA: The semi-finals for High Security
Personnel will be announced

00:03:08.719 --> 00:03:11.490
PA: in a separate
Secure Access Transmission.

00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:12.601
I need to practice.

00:03:12.601 --> 00:03:17.343
PA: Remember: more lives than
your own may depend on your fitness.

00:03:17.343 --> 00:03:18.991
What? We're physicists.

00:03:18.991 --> 00:03:21.723
PA: Do you have a friend or
relative who would make

00:03:21.723 --> 00:03:24.518
PA: a valuable addition
to the Black Mesa Team?

00:03:24.518 --> 00:03:25.544
I don't believe in friends.

00:03:25.544 --> 00:03:29.144
PA: Immediate openings are
available in areas of:

00:03:29.144 --> 00:03:30.937
PA: Materials Handling and

00:03:30.937 --> 00:03:33.230
PA: Low-Clearance Security
Oh, cool! A robot!

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:35.719
Robots are the only friends I need.

00:03:35.719 --> 00:03:37.433
PA: ...for further information.

00:03:37.433 --> 00:03:38.356
Man!

00:03:38.356 --> 00:03:40.429
PA: If you have an associate with a background
Look at that thing!

00:03:40.429 --> 00:03:44.041
PA: in the areas of: theoretical physics,
Looks like a giant worker ant.

00:03:44.041 --> 00:03:45.735
PA: biotechnology,
Man, robots rule!

00:03:45.735 --> 00:03:47.638
PA: or other high-tech disciplines,

00:03:47.638 --> 00:03:49.067
PA: please contact our
Pneumatics rule!

00:03:49.066 --> 00:03:50.808
PA: Civilian Recruitment Division.

00:03:50.809 --> 00:03:51.592
That's awesome.

00:03:51.592 --> 00:03:55.930
PA: The Black Mesa Research Facility
is an equal-opportunity employer.

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:58.344
Man, they're still talking about hiring?

00:03:58.344 --> 00:04:01.051
I guess my cousin Jessie needs a job.

00:04:01.051 --> 00:04:03.323
If only he wasn't a sex-offender,

00:04:03.323 --> 00:04:06.192
it would be so much easier to
find something for him.

00:04:06.192 --> 00:04:09.837
PA: A reminder to all
Black Mesa Personnel:

00:04:09.837 --> 00:04:12.895
PA: Regular radiation and
biohazard screenings

00:04:12.895 --> 00:04:16.286
PA: are a requirement of
continued employment

00:04:16.286 --> 00:04:19.510
PA: in the Black Mesa Research Facility
Bluh! Don't remind me.

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:21.699
PA: Missing a scheduled urinalysis or

00:04:21.699 --> 00:04:24.292
PA: radiation checkup is grounds
Whoa...WE'RE GOING TO CRASH!

00:04:24.292 --> 00:04:25.913
PA: for immediate termination.

00:04:25.913 --> 00:04:27.821
PA: If you feel you have been
Oh, good, it stopped.

00:04:27.821 --> 00:04:31.273
PA: exposed to radioactive or
other hazardous materials

00:04:31.273 --> 00:04:32.143
What are YOU looking at?!

00:04:32.143 --> 00:04:34.041
PA: in the course of your duties,

00:04:34.041 --> 00:04:36.037
PA: contact your Radiation Safety Officer

00:04:36.037 --> 00:04:37.645
PA: immediately.
Hey, what's that green crap?

00:04:37.645 --> 00:04:39.780
PA: Work safe, work smart.
What is this?

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:42.355
PA: Your future depends on it.
Jesus Christ! Look at this place!

00:04:42.355 --> 00:04:44.200
This is a DISASTER!

00:04:45.262 --> 00:04:46.926
PA: Now arriving at
That's gotta be toxic.

00:04:46.926 --> 00:04:51.755
PA: Sector C Test Labs and Control Facilities.
God, the EPA is going to tear us apart

00:04:51.755 --> 00:04:53.167
if they find out about that.

00:04:54.064 --> 00:04:55.987
Well, I'm not saying anything.

00:04:55.987 --> 00:04:58.420
I don't want to get called into
court as a witness on this

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:00.092
once the cat gets out of the bag.

00:05:00.092 --> 00:05:02.931
PA: Please stand back from the
automated door

00:05:02.931 --> 00:05:06.939
PA: and wait for the security
officer to verify your identity.

00:05:06.939 --> 00:05:07.710
Locked!

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:12.671
PA: Before exiting the train, be sure to
check your area for personal belongings.

00:05:12.671 --> 00:05:13.227
Hm...

00:05:13.227 --> 00:05:17.111
PA: Thank you, and have a very
safe and productive day.

00:05:17.111 --> 00:05:19.414
GUARD: Morning, Mr. Freeman.
Looks like you're runnin' late.

00:05:19.414 --> 00:05:21.915
Yeah, you know what? I don't
even care anymore.

00:05:21.915 --> 00:05:25.967
By the time I get suited up, I'm
going to be over an hour late.

00:05:25.967 --> 00:05:28.367
I figure, I'm either fired or I'm not.

00:05:29.351 --> 00:05:31.487
Is someone following me?

00:05:31.487 --> 00:05:32.434
Okay, good.

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:37.368
Yeah, I'm just going to stroll in there
like I own the damned place,

00:05:37.368 --> 00:05:39.767
take my time, maybe get some doughnuts...

00:05:40.208 --> 00:05:43.850
If I'm fired, I could probably jack some
office supplies or computer equipment

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:45.467
or something on the way out.

00:05:45.467 --> 00:05:48.500
I could just stuff things in a big
duffel bag, nobody's going to notice.

00:05:49.357 --> 00:05:51.479
Hmm, y'know, Steve's never in his cubicle.

00:05:51.479 --> 00:05:54.181
I could just walk right up and
take his laptop.

00:05:54.181 --> 00:05:59.263
Hell! I could grab that color laser printer
from Accounting. That thing's nice!

00:05:59.263 --> 00:06:02.477
That's gotta be worth a couple
grand right there.

00:06:02.477 --> 00:06:05.300
Huh, I wonder if it can print money...

